oducts where no Measmerize data exists.~~ | ~~Measmerize~~ | ALL |  | Cancelled |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-052> |\n| PRD-053 | Product & Catalogue | Size Guide | The system should open the Size Guide as a slide out overlay without navigating away from the PDP. | Measmerize | ALL | Custom | Confirmed | Measmerize if data available - display Zimm size guide if not | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-053> |\n| PRD-054 | Product & Catalogue | Size Guide | The system should display size conversion tables appropriate to the selected product; size guide content may differ between product types. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-054> |\n| PRD-055 | Product & Catalogue | Size Guide | The system should manage Size Guide content as a structured content type within Contentful, supporting configuration per product type including but not limited to Ready to Wear, Swim, Accessories, Belts, Jewellery, Men's, Denim, and Hats. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-055> |\n| PRD-056 | Product & Catalogue | Size Guide | The system should display measurements in both centimetres (cm) and inches, with a toggle to switch between units. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-056> |\n| PRD-057 | Product & Catalogue | Size Guide | The system should ensure Size Guide content is manageable without a code deployment - via the CMS or the commerce platform's content tooling. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-057> |