ort flexible image presentation per page type, including configurable background colour or treatment per page (e.g. PDP vs homepage vs bag), without requiring image asset duplication. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-069> |\n| PRD-070 | Product & Catalogue | Product Imagery and Media | The system should enforce that alt text is present on all product images before a product can be published. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-070> |\n| PRD-071 | Product & Catalogue | External marketing product feeds | The system should support product catalogue feed provision through our existing feeds provider, Feedonomics. It should be possible to restrict the volume of product fed into Feedonomics at import rather than once the import is on the Feedonomics servers. The feeds should support product availability, stock positions, pricing, visibility, labels, and other metadata. |  | ALL | Config | Confirmed | Yes, the product fed volume can be controlled through job config. The OOTB product export is in CSV format. If you want a specific format, this will be a custom build. | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-071> |",
